== Effects ==
* Adds 3 {{E|Penny|text=Pennies}} on pickup.
* When Isaac takes damage, spawns 1 or 2 Pennies near him.

== Notes ==
* The coins that are dropped from Piggy Bank are not subtracted from Isaac's total.
* Other types of coins cannot be spawned by Piggy Bank, only normal Pennies.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Dull Razor}}: Activates Piggy Bank's effect without actually taking any damage.
* {{dlc|a}} {{C|Keeper}}/{{C|Tainted Keeper|r}}: Drops 0-1 pennies instead.
* {{i|Piggy Bank}}: Multiple copies will only add 3 more coins on pickup, with no additional coins dropping on taking damage.

